  (text "J1 plugs into the StimHAT's J103 (pin 1 = 5 V), J2 into J102's holes (the JST socket is not fitted then): J2.4 = +V, J2.3 = 0V," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0c03d00d-f7eb-5e44-a579-417cc50df09e"))
  (text "J2.2 = -V, J2.1 = CAB = 0V (the HAT's cable-detect return).  Both are right-angle headers on the pod's bottom edge; the pod" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "264607f7-12bd-5de5-94b4-95c86ce4dec7"))
  (text "stands on the HAT with its parts facing north.  A0515S: 1 W, min. load 10 %; L / C and the Q101 / Q102 multipliers (about 0.6 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fcd3a99a-a376-5b32-93e5-141fd28dbde4"))
  (text "drop per rail, 60 dB ripple rejection above 100 Hz) came off the StimHAT, which keeps C109 / C110 and the 20 V clamps." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ff142563-f4e7-5c3a-a5b8-9f88736b2920"))
